      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "৩. $\\log_a \\left( \\frac{M}{N} \\right) = \\log_a M - \\log_a N$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "\\log_a \\left( \\frac{M}{N} \\right) = \\log_a M - \\log_a N"
